{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561800/extras/95bee14d210d1b54814665d7ba72cbe2.avif?t=1772419419\" width=780 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will take on the role of a brave hero, embarking on a journey to defeat the Demon Lord,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fighting thrilling battles alongside three companions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it's not just your party members who will spoil you\u2014villagers and even the queen herself have prepared plenty of delightful events for you to enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the many characters, you're sure to find your favorite one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons, accidentally trigger traps, or take a relaxing soak in a hot spring...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dreamy adventure awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter what you do, you'll be met with warmth and acceptance\u2014so immerse yourself in this hero-friendly fantasy world to your heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561800/extras/a7c59aff4d0b2ebf339bb0ee9984aebe.avif?t=1772419419\" width=780 height=78 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JRPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill tree system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selectable difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 romanceable characters!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561800?t=1772419419","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561800?t=1772419419","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/